@baseUrl = https://license-server.example.invalid
@token = REPLACE_WITH_CIEM_ACCESS_TOKEN
@organizationId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@sourceId = native-gcp
@beforeId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@afterId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@analysisId = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### Configuration metadata only; never acquires provider credentials
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/effective-decisions/sources
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Explicit one-shot READ-ONLY native evaluation. Use the exact server-configured tuple.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/effective-decisions/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceId": "{{sourceId}}",
  "principal": "alice@example.invalid",
  "permission": "resourcemanager.projects.setIamPolicy",
  "fullResourceName": "//cloudresourcemanager.googleapis.com/projects/sample-project-123",
  "readConsent": true
}

### Consent failure: 400, no provider read
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/effective-decisions/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceId": "{{sourceId}}",
  "principal": "alice@example.invalid",
  "permission": "resourcemanager.projects.setIamPolicy",
  "fullResourceName": "//cloudresourcemanager.googleapis.com/projects/sample-project-123",
  "readConsent": false
}

### Saved history only; no native call
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/effective-decisions?sourceId={{sourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Saved projection only; nonexistent snapshot returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/effective-decisions/{{beforeId}}?sourceId={{sourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Persist a deduplicated analysis from two directly captured observations
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/effective-decisions/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceId": "{{sourceId}}",
  "beforeSnapshotId": "{{beforeId}}",
  "afterSnapshotId": "{{afterId}}"
}

### Read immutable saved analysis without contacting a provider
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/effective-decisions/analyses/{{analysisId}}?sourceId={{sourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
